<title>BRAZIL: Embraer wins $90 mln Portugalia order.</title>
<headline>Embraer wins $90 mln Portugalia order.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's mid-sized aircraft manufacturer Embraer said it had received a firm order for four 50-seat EMB-145's from Portugal's regional carrier Portugalia.</p>
<p>In a statement Embraer said Portugalia also held an option for two other EMB-145's. The statement said the value of the deal was of about $90 million.</p>
</text>
